Output that does not type-check with the hand-written runtime is refused and
nothing is written (phase 5; TestRunRefusesOutputThatDoesNotTypeCheck). Without
a protocolMethods entry no ProtocolMethodCancelRequest is generated, and
connection.go uses it.

-- meta.json --
{"version": 1, "agentMethods": {}, "clientMethods": {}}
-- schema.json --
{"$defs": {
  "U": {"oneOf": [
    {"type": "object", "properties": {"type": {"const": "x", "type": "string"}, "n": {"type": "string"}}, "required": ["type", "n"]},
    {"type": "object", "properties": {"type": {"const": "y", "type": "string"}}, "required": ["type"]}
  ]}
}}
-- want.err --
generated code does not type-check
undefined: ProtocolMethodCancelRequest
